<h1>Guitar Lessons</h1>

<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I'm now offering guitar lessons! This is my first time ever offering lessons. What are my qualifications? I've been playing guitar for 19 years and have spent the last few years finally playing out, developing my solo music act. It started with open mics <small>(<a href="/calendar/"><b>75 last year, 49 so far this year</b></a>)</small> and has quickly turned into regular gigs and shows, both solo and collaboratively. For now, the majority of my online music can be found on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/e9artist">Instagram</a> but you can stream some of my songs on my <a href="/music/"><b>Music</b></a><a href="#fn3" class="footnote-ref" id="ref3" title="Jump to footnote">1</a> page and can <a href="/downloads/"><b>download</b></a> them for free. Other than <a href="#fn2" class="footnote-ref-text" id="ref2" title="Jump to footnote">two years</a> of guitar lessons <small>(taken five years ago)</small>, I'm entirely self-taught, which means I know what it's like to practice the wrong things for way too long. If you're interested in playing like <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joe_Satriani" title="Joe Satriani Wikipedia" target="_blank">Joe Satriani</a> or just wanna accelerate your . <a href="/contact"><b>Contact me</b></a> to schedule a trial lesson! Here's what you need to know:</p>

<h2>Lesson Details</h2>
<ul>
    <li>30, 45, and 60-minute sessions available</li>
    <li>All skill levels welcome</li>
    <li>Styles: Rock, Blues, Jazz, Metal, Prog</li>
    <li>Prefer to come to you but can host if necessary</li>
    <li>First lesson: simple assessment of skill and knowledge level with a discussion of goals</li>
    <li></li>
</ul>

<h2>Pricing</h2>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;$40 for 30min | $55 for 45min | $70 for 60min</p>

<h2>Contact Me</h2>
<p>Fastest way to get ahold of me is to DM me on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/e9artist">Instagram</a>. You can also email<a href="#fn1" class="footnote-ref" id="ref1" title="Jump to footnote">2</a> me: <a href="mailto:bin11101001@gmail.com">bin11101001@gmail.com</a></p>



<div class="footnote">
<p id="fn3"><sup>1</sup> I plan on adding tons of my songs and remixes to my website so check back regularly! <a href="#ref3" class="footnote-return" title="Jump back to text">↩</a></p>

